        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trigger": {
        "type": "timer",
        "time": 900.0
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "show_message",
          "text": "Grave-lights move among the western orchards. The Iron Sepulcher is watching, but the legions remain the greater danger."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trigger": {
        "type": "timer",
        "time": 990.0
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "show_message",
          "text": "ASSAULT III: siege engines and veteran cohorts. Hold every gate until the twentieth minute."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trigger": {
        "type": "timer",
        "time": 1140.0
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "show_message",
          "text": "One minute. Spend the reserve; save the camp."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "commander_messages": [
    {
      "id": "campania_fabius_open",
      "speaker": "roman_legion_organizer",
      "pose": "dismissive",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "mission_start",
        "delay": 2.5
      },
      "text": "You have a walled town, an orchard, and a very great many mouths. I have the roads. I am not going to fight you. I am going to stand between you and every granary in Campania until winter explains my position better than I can.",
      "voice_cue": "alert.commander_message",
      "duration": 9.0,
      "priority": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "campania_fabius_victory",
      "speaker": "roman_legion_organizer",
      "pose": "cynical",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "mission_victory",
        "delay": 1.0
      },
      "text": "Keep Capua, then. I shall come back after the harvest, and after the one following it. I have buried three consuls who were in a hurry. Patience is cheaper, and it does not require a triumph.",
      "voice_cue": "alert.commander_message",
      "duration": 9.0,
      "priority": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "campania_fabius_defeat",
      "speaker": "roman_legion_organizer",
      "pose": "dismissive",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "mission_defeat",
        "delay": 1.0
      },
      "text": "There. No battle, no glory, no monument: a town with nothing left in it and a road with my army standing on it. They will call me the Delayer. Let them. Your dead will not care what I am called.",
      "voice_cue": "alert.commander_message",
      "duration": 9.0,
      "priority": 120
    }
  ],
  "include_ambient_undead": false,
  "victory_mode": "all"
}
